#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:3
#: 6bc60218ba9c4407ae4b5f0e3ff32f7b
msgid "随机掺杂（Random Doping）"
msgstr "Random Doping"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:5
#: c313e5f8b6e747e297b18f2803ceed27
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:7
#: 9d46afb7042547d6bb8f809f9dff2976
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:9
#: 074f1f33b64c42fd9ae81d8c2f9290b7
msgid ""
"按一条或多条规则，把指定元素的部分位点替换为掺杂元素。每条规则回答四个问题：替换哪种元素、是否只处理特定 "
"`group`、替换成什么元素、替换多少个。它适合构造低浓度或局部分组掺杂；若要按一个整体目标组成重新分配全部位点，应使用 `Random Occupancy`。"
msgstr ""
"Use one or more rules to replace some sites of a specified element with dopants. Each"
" rule answers four questions: which element to replace, whether to restrict the "
"operation to particular `group` labels, which dopant elements to use, and how many "
"sites to replace. It is suited to low-concentration or locally grouped doping. Use "
"`Random Occupancy` to redistribute all sites according to one overall target "
"composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:11
#: 1e6096ff218a4044bed5f282b3c6d779
msgid "规则从上到下作用于同一份当前结构。前一条规则改变的元素可能成为后一条规则的候选，因此具有依赖关系的规则必须按预期顺序排列。"
msgstr ""
"Rules act from top to bottom on the same evolving structure. An element produced by "
"an earlier rule may become a candidate for a later rule, so dependent rules must be "
"ordered intentionally."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:13
#: 6d5a6459b4504e658e01d6cb63446f4d
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:15
#: a75c93dfdbf9420a9649e57bed180048
msgid "设某条规则当前有 $N$ 个候选位点。"
msgstr "Suppose a rule currently has $N$ candidate sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:17
#: 15acad5aaad94ab58bfef3f53ac7b284
msgid "使用原子百分比 $p$ 时，替换数为"
msgstr "With atomic percentage $p$, the replacement count is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:19
#: 5495f95f69ed4105a2a608bd94edffa4
msgid ""
"\n"
"n=\\lfloor Np/100\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:23
#: f5b84df472974d098aa93487027c13a4
msgid ""
"百分比填写为区间时，每个输出先在区间内均匀抽取一个百分比，再向下取整。小结构上的低百分比可能始终得到 $n=0$；如果整套规则的最大可能替换数仍为 "
"0，卡片会在运行前报错并建议提高用量或扩大结构。"
msgstr ""
"When a percentage range is entered, every output first samples a percentage uniformly"
" within that range, then rounds down. A low percentage in a small structure may "
"always give $n=0$. If the maximum possible replacement count across the entire rule "
"set is still zero, the card reports an error before running and suggests increasing "
"the amount or enlarging the structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:25
#: 9a02783142a44b6a875794af5858b374
msgid "“质量预算 %”沿用已有 `mass_percent` 数据语义：先把百分比乘以候选目标原子的原始总质量，再除以掺杂元素的平均原子质量："
msgstr ""
"`Mass budget %` retains the existing `mass_percent` data semantics: multiply the "
"percentage by the original total mass of candidate target atoms, then divide by the "
"mean atomic mass of the dopants:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:27
#: bed1cddb4a4f43c7ab3cffac3184a5fb
msgid ""
"\n"
"n=\\left\\lfloor\n"
"\\frac{(p/100)N M_\\mathrm{target}}{\\bar M_\\mathrm{dopant}}\n"
"\\right\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:33
#: 0c693a03f4dd4a028f85c357deb39809
msgid "它表示相对于原目标原子质量的替换预算，不是输出结构的最终质量分数。实际结果应从输出元素和 metadata 重新统计。"
msgstr ""
"This is a replacement budget relative to the original mass of the target atoms, not "
"the final mass fraction of the output structure. Recalculate the realized result from"
" output species and metadata."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:35
#: b2ffc7cb5dc842c1ba53c78bb61e1bb6
msgid "替换总数确定后，“掺杂元素分配”只决定多种掺杂元素如何分享这 $n$ 个位点："
msgstr ""
"After the total replacement count is determined, `Dopant allocation` decides only how"
" multiple dopant elements share these $n$ sites:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:37
#: 59888804400e4036850b337696dabc45
msgid "`Random`：每个位点按权重独立抽样，实际元素计数允许波动；"
msgstr ""
"`Random`: independently sample the element at each site according to its weight, "
"allowing realized element counts to fluctuate;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:38
#: fa140f71e5d14c239424122ca981e6bf
msgid "`Exact`：使用最大余数法得到最近可行的整数计数，再随机打乱落点。"
msgstr ""
"`Exact`: use the largest-remainder method to obtain the nearest feasible integer "
"counts, then randomly shuffle their placement."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:40
#: bfc2a0cdd97a43a59264d1d426a9741c
msgid "若掺杂权重采用质量比 $w_e$，程序先换算为原子抽样概率"
msgstr ""
"If dopant weights are mass ratios $w_e$, the program first converts them to atomic "
"sampling probabilities:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:42
#: e4fa894687f740888a5a40b39f5735d8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"q_e=\\frac{w_e/M_e}{\\sum_j w_j/M_j}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:46
#: 7676a90e6b5b48cebda9729f2d0c02ba
msgid "因此顶层 `Random / Exact` 不改变替换位点总数，只改变 Ge/C 等多种掺杂元素之间的分配。"
msgstr ""
"Thus, the top-level `Random / Exact` choice does not change the total number of "
"replaced sites. It changes only how those sites are allocated among multiple dopants "
"such as Ge and C."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:48
#: 89a62ced0fc140768d7662a5f0cbc70c
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:50
#: c8e19290cddf4af0a250551d5123bc21
msgid "补充 Si–Ge 局域环境"
msgstr "Add Si–Ge Local Environments"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:52
#: bd0e59016e9b4072a2af0315921ea366
msgid "若模型只在纯 Si 结构上训练，Si 位点被 Ge 替换后的局域化学环境没有覆盖。可输入含 64 个 Si 位点的超胞，添加规则："
msgstr ""
"If a model was trained only on pure Si structures, it has not covered the local "
"chemical environments created when Ge replaces Si sites. Provide a supercell "
"containing 64 Si sites and add this rule:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:54
#: bd6cc9646efa49cbbe5afb2bb2b1c89b
msgid "替换元素：`Si`"
msgstr "Target element: `Si`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:55
#: ee8895e5a1734801b1c200ded1c79abb
msgid "替换为：`Ge`"
msgstr "Replace with: `Ge`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:56
#: b02b60c2c4e648f1bc7bb7ff63467c6e
msgid "替换用量：原子百分比 `3–8%`"
msgstr "Replacement amount: atomic percentage `3–8%`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:57
#: 4ff8a779842c402a82121fc45e73499c
msgid "每个输入的输出数：`20`"
msgstr "Outputs per input: `20`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:59
#: 6e3ddeb968004d6dbf391fba908588f4
msgid ""
"界面预览会显示该输入有 64 个候选位点，整数替换范围为 1–5。运行后检查 `random_doping` metadata "
"中的实际替换数和元素计数，再用独立的掺杂结构验证集比较加入这些样本前后的能量、力误差。卡片只改变元素，原子坐标、晶胞和 PBC 保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"The preview shows 64 candidate sites and an integer replacement range of 1–5 for this"
" input. After running, inspect the realized replacement and element counts in "
"`random_doping` metadata, then compare energy and force errors before and after "
"adding these samples on an independent doped-structure validation set. The card "
"changes only elements; atomic coordinates, the cell, and PBC remain unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:61
#: 5b79bd0c7f034003b3ca37d357a14e35
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:63
#: 050ad163f4934ae1a576d7a4d6dcc0db
msgid "规则（rules）"
msgstr "rules"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:65
#: cf17968504b44b3e8adbbf1ada438bd9
msgid "`list[dict[str, Any]]`，默认空列表，但运行至少需要一条完整规则。每条规则包含："
msgstr ""
"`list[dict[str, Any]]`, an empty list by default, but at least one complete rule is "
"required to run. Each rule contains:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:67
#: 5963ee135af74fb783444d37c5961aa2
msgid "`target`：被替换的元素；"
msgstr "`target`: the element to replace;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:68
#: 4e66b0b4f1c2457f9a9f6ac4eead2218
msgid "`dopants`：掺杂元素及相对权重，例如 `Ge:0.7,C:0.3`；"
msgstr "`dopants`: dopant elements and relative weights, for example `Ge:0.7,C:0.3`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:69
#: f0011c01074a4a7fa4b67f1bd60b9e5f
msgid "`ratio_type`：`atom` 或 `mass`，表示 `dopants` 权重的基准；"
msgstr "`ratio_type`: `atom` or `mass`, defining the basis of the `dopants` weights;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:70
#: 7cecad7fa5ca42548415609cddd148c9
msgid "`use`：`atomic_percent`、`mass_percent` 或 `count`；"
msgstr "`use`: `atomic_percent`, `mass_percent`, or `count`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:71
#: 670a5c7e4e5c467890f84f024a623abe
msgid "`percent`：百分比的最小值和最大值；"
msgstr "`percent`: minimum and maximum percentage;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:72
#: 2fe27ca305a249f88e63d4ddcf84b234
msgid "`count`：原子数的最小值和最大值；"
msgstr "`count`: minimum and maximum atom count;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:73
#: ca864e24f6e748a7a6ad07d7a489f7c5
msgid "`count_mode`：`fixed` 或 `random`；"
msgstr "`count_mode`: `fixed` or `random`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:74
#: 66a4eafbe3804b65be4cc90b6e25d8af
msgid "`group`：可选的 group 标签列表。"
msgstr "`group`: optional list of group labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:76
#: d046afa26a0a4b329bb432fc0e6cac38
msgid ""
"固定数量要求 `count` 的两端相同；随机数量在闭区间内抽取整数。填写 group 后，输入必须包含 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` "
"且至少有一个对应目标元素命中。范围上界超过可用位点、规则重叠可能耗尽后续候选时，会在随机采样前确定性报错。"
msgstr ""
"A fixed count requires identical endpoints in `count`; a random count draws an "
"integer from the closed interval. When a group is supplied, the input must contain "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` and at least one target element must match. If a range "
"upper bound exceeds the available sites, or overlapping rules can exhaust candidates "
"needed later, a deterministic error is reported before random sampling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:78
#: 7992701676af49e580bb30544123d4a7
msgid "掺杂元素分配（doping_type）"
msgstr "Dopant Allocation (doping_type)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:80
#: 62939932b59a412ebe1036e8ea275c30
msgid "`str`，默认 `Random`。`Random` 独立抽样各掺杂元素；`Exact` 用最大余数法固定每种掺杂元素的整数计数。二者都随机选择具体被替换位点。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Random`. `Random` samples each dopant independently; `Exact` fixes "
"integer counts for every dopant using the largest-remainder method. Both choose the "
"concrete replacement sites randomly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:82
#: def99d728fe84f4ea1ea8543ee3fb93e
msgid "每个输入的输出数（max_structures）"
msgstr "Outputs per Input (max_structures)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:84
#: 4cfbd8094b57437f9ca7b8baea8f597c
msgid "`int`，默认 1。参数名为兼容已有工作流保留，实际合同是严格数量：每个合法输入生成恰好该数量的输出，不是“最多”。总输出数为"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1. The parameter name is retained for workflow compatibility, but its "
"actual contract is an exact count: every valid input produces precisely this many "
"outputs, not `at most` this many. The total output count is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:86
#: bed1cddb4a4f43c7ab3cffac3184a5fb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=N_\\mathrm{input}\\times\\mathrm{max\\_structures}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:90
#: 968b811427f14401a7290d840d343507
msgid "各输出独立抽样，允许得到相同替换数或相同落点，不做去重。"
msgstr ""
"Outputs are sampled independently and may have the same replacement count or sites; "
"no deduplication is performed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:92
#: ca081d1f3e4447cf809096b218609116
msgid "使用固定随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Fixed Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:94
#: dbe4f06f41854261ab8530995b6bb049
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。开启后使用可复现的样本级派生种子。"
msgstr "`bool`, default false. When enabled, a reproducible sample-level derived seed is used."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:96
#: 3b461a21c924490dab68190f729c9064
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:98
#: 0f2e96dfb6c84d329bb1f367b23ed093
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0，无单位，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。派生种子结合基础 seed、输入 `Config_type` 的稳定 ID "
"和样本序号；相同输入、参数和 seed 可复现。不同输入若 `Config_type` 也完全相同，仍可能复用相同随机路径。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 0, dimensionless and used only when `use_seed=true`. The derived seed "
"combines the base seed, a stable ID of the input `Config_type`, and the sample index."
" Identical inputs, parameters, and seeds are reproducible. Different inputs whose "
"`Config_type` values are also identical may still reuse the same random path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:100
#: 336a88e9761b432198671f7773632968
msgid "推荐配置"
msgstr "Recommended Configuration"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:102
#: 3cfcf08068a0452e99e42684354ee5de
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomDopingCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"rules\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"target\": \"Si\",\n"
"        \"dopants\": {\"Ge\": 0.7, \"C\": 0.3},\n"
"        \"ratio_type\": \"atom\",\n"
"        \"use\": \"atomic_percent\",\n"
"        \"percent\": [3, 8],\n"
"        \"count\": [1, 1],\n"
"        \"count_mode\": \"fixed\",\n"
"        \"group\": []\n"
"      }\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"doping_type\": \"Exact\",\n"
"    \"max_structures\": 20,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 101\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:127
#: f463e5a9d9374d8b8ffca5da9be93f82
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:129
#: 6459a98de060475098835c9dd2731a88
msgid "**为什么提示无法替换任何原子？** 候选位点数乘以百分比后会向下取整。检查界面预览的整数范围；若最大值仍为 0，请提高用量或先扩大结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the card report that no atoms can be replaced?** Candidate-site count "
"multiplied by the percentage is rounded down. Inspect the integer range in the "
"preview; if its maximum is still zero, increase the amount or enlarge the structure "
"first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:131
#: 00773d6ed4c84443999f135e2466bc40
msgid "**为什么选择固定配比后，替换总数仍会变化？** 固定配比只固定多种掺杂元素之间的整数分配。替换总数仍由每条规则的百分比或随机数量范围决定。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the total replacement count still vary after selecting an exact ratio?** "
"Exact allocation fixes only the integer distribution among multiple dopant elements. "
"The total replacement count is still determined by each rule's percentage or random "
"count range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:133
#: daef95dbbc544d14b5e28f4492fbe2f7
msgid "**为什么 group 规则没有运行？** 输入必须包含 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`，标签拼写必须匹配，而且对应分组中必须存在被替换元素。"
msgstr ""
"**Why did the group rule not run?** The input must contain `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`,"
" label spelling must match, and the target element must exist in the corresponding "
"group."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:135
#: bb69dfd55c534a0994495d5d917a5ce0
msgid "输出与迁移说明"
msgstr "Output and Migration Notes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:137
#: 7543acc3cc244dd0a2779736ee6f1740
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 追加 `Dop(n=...)`。`atoms.info[\"random_doping\"]` 是 JSON "
"字符串，记录分配模式、样本序号、实际派生 seed、总替换数，以及每条规则的候选位点数、实际替换数和实际掺杂元素计数。"
msgstr ""
"`Dop(n=...)` is appended to `Config_type`. `atoms.info[\"random_doping\"]` is a JSON "
"string recording the allocation mode, sample index, actual derived seed, total "
"replacement count, and for each rule its candidate-site count, realized replacement "
"count, and realized dopant-element counts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:139
#: 393a51a05a9e41ac8f73ef98c086fd1e
msgid ""
"只要元素实际改变，原有 calculator、能量、力、应力、virial、磁矩、spin、charges 等物种相关参考标签会被清除；坐标、晶胞、PBC、group "
"和普通来源信息保留。"
msgstr ""
"Whenever elements actually change, species-dependent reference data such as the "
"calculator, energy, forces, stress, virial, magnetic moments, spin, and charges are "
"cleared. Coordinates, the cell, PBC, group, and ordinary provenance information are "
"retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:141
#: 85e03c48a94e41f9852b80b0bfd5d083
msgid ""
"本次调整保留旧 JSON 字段和值，但有三项有意变化：空规则和确定无替换效果的规则不再返回未改变结构；固定 seed "
"的旧随机序列会因样本级派生方式而改变；随机范围合法抽到 0 时仍会显式写入 `Dop(n=0)` 和 metadata，便于识别该端点。"
msgstr ""
"This revision preserves legacy JSON fields and values but intentionally changes three"
" behaviors: empty rules and rules guaranteed to make no replacements no longer return"
" an unchanged structure; legacy fixed-seed random sequences change because of sample-"
"level derivation; and a valid random range that draws zero still writes `Dop(n=0)` "
"and metadata explicitly so that endpoint can be identified."

#~ msgid "按规则表对指定元素位点做替位掺杂。可以精确控制\"替换谁、换成什么、换多少\"，支持按原子百分比、质量百分比或固定数量采样。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Apply substitutional doping to specified element "
#~ "sites using an explicit rule table. Each "
#~ "rule controls which species is replaced, the"
#~ " dopant distribution, and the amount by "
#~ "atomic percentage, mass percentage, or fixed "
#~ "count."

#~ msgid "**和 `Random Occupancy` / `Composition Sweep` 的区别：**"
#~ msgstr "**How it differs from `Random Occupancy` and `Composition Sweep`:**"

#~ msgid "`Composition Sweep`：定义\"目标配比空间\"，不改原子占位"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Composition Sweep` defines a target-composition "
#~ "space without changing occupations."

#~ msgid "`Doping Type`：`Exact` （对比实验需要稳定的掺杂数量）"
#~ msgstr "`Doping Type`: `Exact` for a stable dopant count in comparisons."

#~ msgid "需要系统扫配比空间 → 先用 `Composition Sweep`，再接 `Random Occupancy`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A composition domain must be scanned; use "
#~ "`Composition Sweep` followed by `Random Occupancy`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "rule 内的典型字段：`target`（被替换元素）、`dopants`（替换元素及权重 "
#~ "dict）、`use`（`atomic_percent` / `mass_percent` / "
#~ "`count`）、`percent`（百分比范围 `[min, max]` 或 "
#~ "`[fixed]`）、`count`（固定替换个数）、`group`（可选，限制只在此 group 内操作）。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Typical rule fields are `target`, weighted "
#~ "`dopants`, `use` (`atomic_percent`, `mass_percent`, or "
#~ "`count`), `percent` (`[min,max]` or `[fixed]`), "
#~ "fixed `count`, and optional `group` restriction."

#~ msgid "`str`，默认 `Random`。`Random` 按权重概率随机采样，每帧替换数量有浮动。`Exact` 尽量匹配精确计数，替换数量更稳定，适合对比实验。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `Random`. `Random` samples weighted"
#~ " probabilities and permits count fluctuations. "
#~ "`Exact` matches integer counts as closely as"
#~ " possible and is better for controlled "
#~ "comparisons."

#~ msgid "`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy` → `Random Doping`：先扫配比 → 落位 → 再补局部随机替换"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Composition Sweep` -> `Random Occupancy` -> "
#~ "`Random Doping`: scan composition, realize "
#~ "occupations, then add targeted substitutions"

#~ msgid "**输出和输入一样，没有替换。** 检查 rules 是否为空、target 元素是否真的存在于输入结构中、group 过滤是否把候选位点全滤掉了。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output is unchanged.** Check for nonempty "
#~ "rules, a target present in the input, "
#~ "and a group filter that leaves eligible "
#~ "sites."

#~ msgid "**多条规则之间的交互。** 规则按顺序执行。如果两条规则操作同一个 target 元素，第二条会在第一条的结果上继续替换。注意不要设计互相冲突的规则。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Rule interactions.** Rules execute in order. "
#~ "A later rule targeting the same species "
#~ "operates on the result of earlier rules, "
#~ "so avoid conflicts."

#~ msgid "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` 可复现。注意输入结构顺序变化也会影响结果——建议把 seed 与 pipeline 配置一起版本化。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` for "
#~ "reproducibility. Input order also affects derived"
#~ " samples, so version the seed with the "
#~ "pipeline configuration."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按规则表对指定元素位点做替位掺杂。可以精确控制\"替换谁、换成什么、换多少\"，支持按原子百分比、质量百分比或固定数量采样。规则填写了 group"
#~ " 时，输入必须真的带有对应标签；卡片不会把缺失的 group 当成“全部位点”。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Perform substitutional doping on selected element"
#~ " sites according to a rule table. Control"
#~ " exactly \"which elements to replace, what "
#~ "to replace them with, and how many\", "
#~ "using atomic percentages, mass percentages, or "
#~ "fixed counts. When a rule specifies a "
#~ "group, the input must actually carry that "
#~ "label; the card does not treat a missing"
#~ " group as \"all sites\"."

#~ msgid "**和 `Random Occupancy` / `Composition Space Sampling` 的区别：**"
